━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
Patch 1: pa┃Patch 2: pa
   tch1    ┃   tch2
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Patch mode: comparisons
use only the source
lines quoted in the
patches.

═══════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES*
═══════════════════════
Signs mark edits made
by only that patch. A
sign-less line with one
number is an edit both
patches make: a new
number means both add
it, an old number means
both remove it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│f ┃ old new│f
        │@@┃        │@@
        │ w┃        │ w
   1    │w ┃   1    │w
+      1│w2┃+      1│w3
   2   2│z ┃   2   2│zz
       3│X ┃       3│X
   3   4│q ┃   3   4│q

═══════════════════════
*  CONTEXT DIFFERENCES*
═══════════════════════
Signs mark lines
present in only one
result: - patch1, +
patch2.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
     new│f ┃     new│f
        │@@┃        │@@
        │ w┃        │ w
        │2 ┃        │3
-      1│w2┃+      1│w3
-      2│z ┃+      2│zz
       3│X ┃       3│X
       4│q ┃       4│q
